@* The only component in the app permitted to produce a MarkupString. Recipe steps and notes are
   imported from arbitrary web pages, so the text is treated as hostile: raw HTML never survives
   parsing, and every link, image and autolink address is checked against an allow-list of schemes
   before it reaches the browser. Anything else is flattened to plain text.

   The typography lives here as arbitrary variants rather than in a stylesheet because Tailwind
   only scans .razor files — a class named in a code-behind is never emitted. *@

